hived_by":null},{"id":890310502,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA1MDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:import","name":"topic:import","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2025-12-06T20:35:08Z","updated_at":"2026-05-27T15:49:31Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.5.1.stable\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 10 - 4.5.1.stable\n\n### Issue description\n\nIf you create a character scene with a blendshape animation, import it into another scene and then save and reload the project you will get this constant error:\n\n`ERROR: scene/3d/mesh_instance_3d.cpp:170 - Index p_blend_shape = 0 is out of bounds ((int)blend_shape_tracks.size() = 0).`\n\nThis is due to the objects blendshapes not appearing in the mesh in the scene that the blendshape obj was imported into. To remove this error, you need to go scene you imported the object/character scene and clear the meshes containing the blendshapes then undo. \n\nThis error happens everytime you load up or reload the project file...\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create a 3D Scene, the character/object\n- Import object with a blendshape\n- keyframe the blendshape value to an animation\n- Create another 3D Scene, the level\n- import the character/object scene into the level scene\n- save and reload the project \n- go to the level scene, and play the animation with the blendshape value keyframed\n- you will get this constant error\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN.A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113693/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":1,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113693/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}